Interruption (interrupted/)
  The operator PC's session dropped at about 15:19 UTC, during round 3 cell 3 (C2, 200/s,
  stock 2,000, run 20261106T151827Z).
  - The JMeter host had no result for it, and its collector was left running.
  - The collector was stopped, and the partial folder (collector.json, samples.csv) was
    renamed interrupted-... and kept in interrupted/supp-interrupted.tgz. It is not used.
  - The cell was rerun from a full reset as 20261106T152521Z, then the rest of round 3 ran.
  Earlier, run 2 of round 1 never started (a driver argument error, rejected before any
  reset or load). The driver was fixed and the round continued; no data exists for that
  attempt.

